# Togetherly - Workforce Intelligence Platform
# Environment configuration template

# Supabase Integration
# Public project URL (from your Supabase project dashboard -> Project Settings -> API)
# IMPORTANT: Provide the Project URL base only (https://<project-ref>.supabase.co).
# Do NOT include `/rest/v1`, `/auth/v1`, or trailing slashes. Do NOT wrap values in quotes.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co

# Public anonymous / publishable API key (safe for client-side frontend use)
# Accepts either standard JWT anon keys (eyJ...) or new publishable keys (sb_publishable_...).
# CRITICAL: NEVER provide a service_role secret key in frontend environment variables.
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key-here
